# Tauri boundaries

## Plugins

**Zero** `@tauri-apps/*` imports in `plugins/**`. Use app-provided APIs instead:

| Need | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Filesystem | `app.fs` + `BaseDirectory` from `@stream-kit/plugin` |
| Processes | `app.process` |
| OAuth | `app.oauth` |
| Hotkeys | `app.hotkeys` |
| Open URLs/files | `app.opener` |
| Local TTS | `app.localTts` |

Prefer `BaseDirectory.AppData` for plugin-owned files (e.g. Core action logs).

## App layer only

`invoke`, `@tauri-apps/plugin-fs`, `dialog`, `global-shortcut`, `store`, and Rust commands live under `packages/app` (typically `src/lib/core/**` and `src-tauri/**`).

## New platform capability

1. Add the surface to `PluginAppApi` (`plugin-app-api.types.ts`).
2. Implement it in `app-api.ts` (Tauri wiring stays here).
3. Call it from plugins via `app.*` — never import Tauri from plugin code.
